# Workspace definitions (P3-A)

P3-A introduces **DB-backed workspace metadata** so a vertical's **data plane** (`fieldRegistry`, `ruleSet`, `wizard`) can be authored, versioned, and assigned per tenant without shipping a new npm package. Package plugins (`denali`, `urban`, `starter`) remain the default production path; metadata **coexists** behind `WORKSPACE_METADATA_ENABLED` until P3-D cutover.

This document is the **architecture SoT** for P3-A. Nano execution order and assertion IDs live in [`TEMP/p3/p3-a-workspace-definitions.md`](../../TEMP/p3/p3-a-workspace-definitions.md) v1.3.

---

## Executive summary

| Layer | Owner | Persisted? |
|-------|-------|------------|
| **Data plane** | DB `workspace_definition_versions.payload` | ✅ JSONB |
| **Hook plane** | Package overlay (`validation`, `lifecycle`, `wizardHost`, finance, tourList, …) | ❌ never in JSON |
| **Composite React** | Package manifest → codegen bindings | ❌ not in JSON |
| **Tenant routing** | `tenants.workspaceType` + optional `workspaceDefinitionId` | ✅ columns |

**Status (2026-06-21):** A1–A6 landed (12/12 nanos). **P3-A complete** — P3-B unblocked.

---

## Goals

| Goal | Detail |
|------|--------|
| Data-only plugin core | Persist serializable subset of `WorkspacePlugin` |
| Immutable versioning | INSERT-only version rows; SHA-256 checksum audit |
| Runtime adapter | Merge DB payload + package overlay → valid `WorkspacePlugin` |
| Platform API | List definitions; assign/clear tenant binding |
| Denali safety | Export → seed JSON only; zero Denali package edits in P3-A PRs |
| Ingress readiness | Tenant-aware resolve spec for validation + clone + wizard template |

## Non-goals (P3-A)

| Item | EPIC |
|------|------|
| Generic `platform.*` widgets | P3-B |
| Super Admin builder + publish HTTP | P3-C |
| Parity tests + prod cutover | P3-D |
| Persisting hook functions in JSON | never in P3-A |
| Metadata-only tenant (no overlay) | deferred P3-D |
| `POST .../workspace-definitions/:id/versions` publish | P3-C |

---

## Industry alignment

| Pattern | Source | P3-A mapping |
|---------|--------|--------------|
| **Metadata-driven extensibility** | [OpenG2P Registry](https://docs.openg2p.org/products/registry/registry/features/metadata-driven-extensibility) — domain expressed via metadata tables, stable runtime core | `fieldRegistry` + `ruleSet` in JSONB; hooks stay in package |
| **Hierarchical config merge** | [ObjectOS](https://docs.objectstack.ai/docs/protocol/objectos) — global → tenant overrides | Package overlay (base) + DB payload (tenant-specific data plane override) |
| **Plugin registry + semver** | [Adverant Nexus Plugin Registry](https://adverant.ai/docs/core-services/web-core-services-plugin-registry) | `contractVersion: 1` gate; `(definitionId, version)` pin |
| **Versioned config + rollback** | [OpenDecree](https://github.com/opendecree/decree) — every change versioned, rollback without data migration | Repoint tenant binding to older version row |
| **Strangler Fig facade** | Phase 6 research — `resolveWorkspacePluginForType` → tenant-aware resolve | `resolveWorkspacePluginForTenantContext` ✅ (N-011) |
| **SDUI field registry** | Phase 12 composite registry — `field.id` → `uiHints.compositeId` | Same pipeline; DB stores ids, package supplies React |

---

## Two-plane architecture

```text
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                     WorkspacePlugin (runtime)                    │
├──────────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────┤
│ DATA PLANE (DB metadata)     │ HOOK PLANE (package overlay)       │
│ · fieldRegistry              │ · validation.validateCanonical     │
│ · ruleSet                    │ · lifecycle.*                    │
│ · wizard (WorkspaceWizardSurface) │ · wizardHost.compositeSurfaceId │
│                              │ · wizardMedia, finance HTTP      │
│                              │ · tourList, tourClone, publicCatalog │
│                              │ · operatorSettings, draftTombstone │
└──────────────────────────────┴──────────────────────────────────┘
         ▲                                    ▲
         │ adaptMetadataPayloadToWorkspacePlugin
         │                                    │
   workspace_definition_versions         resolveWorkspacePluginForType(workspaceType)
```

```mermaid
erDiagram
  workspace_definitions ||--o{ workspace_definition_versions : has
  workspace_definitions ||--o{ tenants : assigned_to
  tenants {
    uuid id PK
    text workspace_type
    text workspace_definition_id FK
    int workspace_definition_version
  }
  workspace_definitions {
    text id PK
    text display_name
    text status
  }
  workspace_definition_versions {
    uuid id PK
    text definition_id FK
    int version
    jsonb payload
    text checksum
    timestamptz published_at
  }
```

**Invariant:** `assertWorkspacePlugin(merged)` must pass. Metadata-only payload without overlay is **invalid** today.

---

## Data model (A1 + A5)

### Migrations

| Migration | Path |
|-----------|------|
| Definitions tables | `apps/api/prisma/migrations/20260621160000_workspace_definitions/` |
| Tenant binding columns | `apps/api/prisma/migrations/20260621170000_tenant_workspace_definition/` |

### `workspace_definitions`

| Column | Type | Notes |
|--------|------|-------|
| `id` | `TEXT` PK | slug — e.g. `denali-tour-ops` |
| `displayName` | `TEXT` | Super Admin label |
| `status` | `TEXT` | `draft` \| `published` \| `archived` |
| `createdAt` / `updatedAt` | `TIMESTAMPTZ` | |

Prisma: `apps/api/prisma/schema.prisma` → `model WorkspaceDefinition`

### `workspace_definition_versions`

| Column | Type | Notes |
|--------|------|-------|
| `id` | `UUID` PK | |
| `definitionId` | `TEXT` FK | CASCADE delete with parent definition |
| `version` | `INT` | monotonic per definition; unique `(definitionId, version)` |
| `pluginApiVersion` | `INT` | mirrors `payload.contractVersion` (currently `1`) |
| `payload` | `JSONB` | `WorkspaceDefinitionPayload` |
| `checksum` | `TEXT` | SHA-256 stable-sorted JSON |
| `publishedAt` | `TIMESTAMPTZ` NULL | NULL = draft row (not loadable by repository) |
| `createdByPlatformOpsUserId` | `UUID` NULL | P3-C publish |
| `createdAt` | `TIMESTAMPTZ` | |

**Repository rule:** `getPublishedVersion` returns null when `publishedAt === null`.

### Tenant binding

| Column | Type | Notes |
|--------|------|-------|
| `workspaceDefinitionId` | `TEXT` NULL FK | `onDelete: SetNull` — definition delete clears binding |
| `workspaceDefinitionVersion` | `INT` NULL | pin; NULL = latest published at resolve time |

`workspaceType` **remains** for package overlay source, finance HTTP host, RLS, and marketing until P3-D.

