## Runtime loader (A3)

```text
apps/api/src/workspace-metadata/
  is-workspace-metadata-enabled.ts
  workspace-definition.repository.ts
  metadata-plugin-adapter.ts
  load-workspace-plugin-for-tenant.ts
  read-tenant-workspace-metadata-binding.ts
  build-workspace-definition-export.ts
  index.ts
```

### Resolution algorithm

```typescript
// load-workspace-plugin-for-tenant.ts — simplified
async function resolveWorkspacePluginForTenant(input) {
  const packagePlugin = resolveWorkspacePluginForType(input.workspaceType);
  if (!isWorkspaceMetadataEnabled() || !input.metadataBinding?.definitionId) {
    return packagePlugin;
  }
  const row = await loadPublishedVersion(definitionId, version ?? null);
  if (!row) throw WORKSPACE_DEFINITION_NOT_FOUND;
  return adaptMetadataPayloadToWorkspacePlugin(parseDefinitionPayload(row), packagePlugin);
}
```

```mermaid
flowchart TD
  START[resolveWorkspacePluginForTenant] --> FLAG{WORKSPACE_METADATA_ENABLED?}
  FLAG -->|false| PKG[return packagePlugin]
  FLAG -->|true| BIND{metadataBinding.definitionId?}
  BIND -->|no| PKG
  BIND -->|yes| LOAD[getPublishedVersion]
  LOAD -->|null| ERR[WORKSPACE_DEFINITION_NOT_FOUND]
  LOAD -->|row| ADP[adaptMetadataPayloadToWorkspacePlugin]
  ADP --> OUT[assertWorkspacePlugin merged]
```

### Adapter merge (`metadata-plugin-adapter.ts`)

```typescript
const plugin: WorkspacePlugin = {
  ...overlay,                    // hooks, wizardHost, finance, tourList, …
  id: payload.id,
  version: payload.version,
  contractVersion: payload.contractVersion,
  supportedWorkspaceTypes: payload.supportedWorkspaceTypes,
  fieldRegistry: payload.fieldRegistry,   // DB wins
  ruleSet: payload.ruleSet,               // DB wins
  wizard: payload.wizard,                 // DB wins
};
assertWorkspacePlugin(plugin);
```

### Tenant-by-id entry

`resolveWorkspacePluginForTenantById(tenantId)` → reads Prisma tenant row → `toTenantWorkspaceMetadataBinding` → `resolveWorkspacePluginForTenant`.

