| Env | Default | Values | Behavior |
|-----|---------|--------|----------|
| `WORKSPACE_METADATA_ENABLED` | unset / false | `true`, `1`, `yes` | Master gate — false forces package path always |

Implementation: `is-workspace-metadata-enabled.ts`

