## Platform API (A5)

Auth: `Authorization: Bearer` + `X-Platform-Ops-Phone` (same as P1 platform ops).

| Method | Path | RBAC | Status |
|--------|------|------|--------|
| `GET` | `/platform/v1/workspace-definitions` | ops read (all roles) | ✅ |
| `PATCH` | `/platform/v1/tenants/:tenantId/workspace-definition` | write (owner/admin) | ✅ |

Registrar: `apps/api/src/http/platform-route-registrar.ts`  
Routes: `workspace-definitions-list.ts`, `tenants-workspace-definition-patch.ts`

### GET list response

```json
{
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "denali-tour-ops",
      "displayName": "Denali Tour Ops",
      "status": "published",
      "latestPublishedVersion": 1
    }
  ]
}
```

### PATCH assign body

```json
{
  "definitionId": "denali-tour-ops",
  "definitionVersion": 1
}
```

Clear binding:

```json
{ "definitionId": null }
```

`definitionVersion` omitted or null → pin **latest published** at resolve time (stored as NULL on tenant row).

### PATCH response

```json
{
  "workspaceDefinition": {
    "definitionId": "denali-tour-ops",
    "definitionVersion": 1,
    "displayName": "Denali Tour Ops"
  }
}
```

Clear returns `{ "workspaceDefinition": null }`.

### PATCH validation errors

| HTTP | When |
|------|------|
| 401 | Missing ops auth |
| 403 | Support role without write |
| 404 | Unknown tenant |
| 422 | Unknown/unpublished definition id |

Service: `update-platform-tenant-workspace-definition.ts`

---

## Audit events (A5 — landed)

| Action | Constant | When |
|--------|----------|------|
| Assign binding | `TENANT_DEFINITION_ASSIGNED` | PATCH with definitionId |
| Clear binding | `TENANT_DEFINITION_CLEARED` | PATCH with definitionId null |

Metadata: `{ tenantId, definitionId, definitionVersion, previousDefinitionId, previousDefinitionVersion }`

`WORKSPACE_DEFINITION_PUBLISHED` → **P3-C** (not P3-A).

