## Export + seed (A4)

| Artifact | Path |
|----------|------|
| Export CLI | `apps/api/scripts/export-workspace-definition.ts` |
| Export builder | `build-workspace-definition-export.ts` |
| Denali snapshot | `apps/api/scripts/seed/definitions/denali-v1.json` (~2078 lines) |
| Seed runner | `apps/api/scripts/seed-workspace-definitions.ts` |
| Default exports map | `DEFAULT_WORKSPACE_DEFINITION_EXPORTS` — denali, starter, urban |

```bash
pnpm --filter @apps/api run export:workspace-definition -- \
  --workspace denali --out scripts/seed/definitions/denali-v1.json

pnpm --filter @apps/api run db:seed   # includes seedWorkspaceDefinitionsFromDir
```

Export envelope:

```json
{
  "definitionId": "denali-tour-ops",
  "displayName": "Denali Tour Ops",
  "workspaceType": "denali",
  "version": 1,
  "payload": { "...": "WorkspaceDefinitionPayload" },
  "checksum": "<sha256>"
}
```

**Covenant:** export uses `resolveWorkspacePluginForType` (registry) — no direct `@app-tour/workspace-denali` imports under `apps/api/src/`.

---

## Versioning & schema evolution

| Action | Behavior |
|--------|----------|
| Publish vN+1 | INSERT; prior rows immutable |
| Assign tenant | PATCH sets binding; audit ASSIGNED |
| Pin version | Store explicit int; NULL = latest at load |
| Roll back | Repoint to older version — **no tour migration** |
| Breaking change | New `definitionId` or P3-D upcaster — never UPDATE payload |

Additive-only inside same id: new optional registry fields, widened enums.

---

## Production ingress (A6 — N-011/N-012)

`resolveWorkspacePluginForTenantById` exists; production P0 ingress call sites use `resolveWorkspacePluginForTenantContext` (N-011 landed):

```text
apps/api/src/workspace/resolve-workspace-plugin-for-tenant-context.ts
  export async function resolveWorkspacePluginForTenantContext(
    tenantId: string,
    workspaceType: string,
  ): Promise<WorkspacePlugin>
```

When `WORKSPACE_METADATA_ENABLED` false → sync `resolveWorkspacePluginForType` (zero behavior change).

### Ingress matrix (tiered)

| Tier | File | Function | Why |
|------|------|----------|-----|
| **P0 MUST** | `tours/canonical-validation-sync.ts` | `getOrCreateValidationEngine`, `validateCanonicalBeforePersistSync` | fieldRegistry + ruleSet drive validation |
| **P0 MUST** | `tours/build-clone-tour-body.ts` | `buildCloneTourCreateBody` | uses `plugin.wizard.roots` |
| **P0 MUST** | `settings/wizard-template-catalog.ts` | `assertWizardTemplateFieldsKnown` | fieldRegistry defines allowed template paths |
| **P1 SHOULD** | `tours/list-tours-operator.ts` | `listToursOperator` | tourList hook from overlay — metadata optional v1.1 |
| **P1 SHOULD** | `tours/get-tour-operator.ts` | `buildOperatorTourDetailResponse` | same — overlay hook |
| **NO v1** | `settings/settings-registry.ts` | `listSettingsModuleMetadataForTenant` | `operatorSettings` from overlay only |
| **NO v1** | `workspace-drafts/workspace-drafts.service.ts` | `patchWorkspaceDraft` | `draftTombstone` from overlay |
| **NO v1** | `marketing/should-invalidate-marketing-catalog.ts` | | `publicCatalog` hook from overlay |

### Engine cache key extension (critical)

Current key: `${tenantId}:${workspaceType}:${validationVariant}` (`canonical-validation-sync.ts:73–78`).

When metadata binding changes, fieldRegistry changes but cache may serve stale engine.

**N-011 requirement:** extend key with metadata fingerprint:

```text
${tenantId}:${workspaceType}:${variant}:${definitionId ?? "_pkg"}:${definitionVersion ?? "latest"}
```

Or call `resetValidationEngineCacheForTests` pattern as `invalidateValidationEngineCacheForTenant(tenantId)` from `updatePlatformTenantWorkspaceDefinition` after assign/clear.

### Sync vs async strategy

| Path | Strategy |
|------|----------|
| HTTP handlers | `await resolveWorkspacePluginForTenantContext` |
| `validateCanonicalBeforePersistSync` | Add async sibling `validateCanonicalBeforePersistAsync` OR prefetch plugin before sync body when tenantId known |
| Worker threads | Document fallback: package-only until worker passes binding snapshot (acceptable when flag off) |

Minimal v1: any function with `tenantId` in signature **must** use tenant context resolve when flag on.

