## Security & isolation

| Concern | Mechanism |
|---------|-----------|
| Platform tables | Admin Prisma client; platform ops auth |
| Tenant binding | FK `onDelete: SetNull` — no orphan crashes |
| RLS | Existing tenant-scoped tour data unchanged |
| Import boundary | SDK/platform-core must not import `packages/workspaces/*` |
| API surface | No public tenant CRUD for definitions — internal loader only |

