## Error catalog

| Code / prefix | Source | When |
|---------------|--------|------|
| `PLUGIN_FUNCTION_NOT_ALLOWED` | SDK validate | Hook or function in payload |
| `PLUGIN_INVALID_SHAPE` | SDK validate | Schema / alignment fail |
| `WORKSPACE_DEFINITION_NOT_FOUND:<id>` | loader | Missing/unpublished version |
| `WORKSPACE_DEFINITION_EXPORT_CHECKSUM_MISMATCH` | parse export file | Tampered seed JSON |
| `PLATFORM_VALIDATION` | PATCH assign | Unknown definition |
| `TENANT_NOT_FOUND:<id>` | resolveById | Invalid tenant |

